                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6fca55bd-fe84-391d-9236-401eb2a5a85d",
                        "entry_id": "5427e4b6-0731-359e-9a2d-eacfeeb0bd65",
                        "glosses": [
                            "betrekking hebbend op een parochie en de mensen die deel uitmaken van een parochie"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "124f64fe-d30b-4c76-99f9-8eb8d8e4d72d",
                                "sense_id": "6fca55bd-fe84-391d-9236-401eb2a5a85d",
                                "text": "De opnamen van de mis bereikten bisschop Punt van het bisdom Haarlem-Amsterdam twee dagen later. Nog diezelfde dag ontbood hij de Oranjepriester bij zich. De pastoor werd voor twee maanden geschorst, een tuchtmaatregel die in de parochie tot grote commotie leidde. De media kwamen massaal op Obdam af en tekenden verontwaardigde reacties op. „Vlaar moet blijven. Punt”, zei de vicevoorzitter van het parochiaal bestuur."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "adaed889-7452-30e4-9f00-29360ae07c2d",
                        "entry_id": "5427e4b6-0731-359e-9a2d-eacfeeb0bd65",
                        "glosses": [
                            "betrekking hebbend op een wijk of gemeente"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a66f9e78-2856-4429-bd39-e9782d407cf3",
                                "sense_id": "adaed889-7452-30e4-9f00-29360ae07c2d",
                                "text": "B. liep een reeks veroordelingen op. Zo pleegde hij in 2015 een overval op een parochiaal centrum in Oostende. Na die feiten vluchtte hij weg op een gestolen mountainbike. Over de fietsdiefstallen had Michel B. een opvallende uitleg klaar. Hij beweerde dat hij de fietsen ‘gevonden’ had. ‘Er is een verschil tussen stelen en een fiets meenemen die open staat’, zei hij."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ee318d07-65ae-4aeb-81e3-077b2e00c3f8",
                        "source_entry_id": "5427e4b6-0731-359e-9a2d-eacfeeb0bd65",
                        "source_sense_id": "6fca55bd-fe84-391d-9236-401eb2a5a85d",
                        "target_lang_word": "parochial",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "parochial",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fd06cdd5-2a08-334b-a74f-2db957604f18",
                                        "entry_id": "f09a31fc-721b-3a34-a430-ff045843e266",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Pertaining to a parish."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bfc65355-2e7e-3e81-907a-b0f3a73a3de4",
                                        "entry_id": "f09a31fc-721b-3a34-a430-ff045843e266",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Characterized by an unsophisticated focus on local concerns to the exclusion of wider contexts; elementary in scope or outlook."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "derogatory"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e946d474-732c-49aa-b97e-b419b6613ef2",
                                                "sense_id": "bfc65355-2e7e-3e81-907a-b0f3a73a3de4",
                                                "text": "The use of simple, primary colors in the painting gave it a parochial feel."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "64bfe112-7bf4-427d-a26f-918ff42c694b",
                                                "sense_id": "bfc65355-2e7e-3e81-907a-b0f3a73a3de4",
                                                "text": "Some people in the United States have been accused of taking a parochial view, of not being interested in international matters."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "863637fd-5729-40dc-865b-7697902a4a6b",
                                                "sense_id": "bfc65355-2e7e-3e81-907a-b0f3a73a3de4",
                                                "text": "But for men of principle and honour and straightforward thought there could be no middle course and no paltering with petty issues of party or parochial advantage."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "92615359-f4e4-4469-9181-3346b9b33f92",
                                                "sense_id": "bfc65355-2e7e-3e81-907a-b0f3a73a3de4",
                                                "text": "Its atmosphere might have been provincial, but it was never merely parochial."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7080c467-0a02-4b9c-aac2-5eb4d19a4cce",
                                                "sense_id": "bfc65355-2e7e-3e81-907a-b0f3a73a3de4",
                                                "text": "Gay USA would be of interest to both straight and gay audiences, but because it deals with gay people some bookers or distributors might feel that it is too parochial."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a78a4f32-4730-48bf-ae60-23e00ac5da3b",
                                                "sense_id": "bfc65355-2e7e-3e81-907a-b0f3a73a3de4",
                                                "text": "The society had apparently been formed the previous year, but as the Cheltenham Spa Railway Society, which sounded rather parochial and unambitious - particularly as (by all accounts) its founders had gathered in a garden shed in the town."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "parochial",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e43546ce-663e-31ab-b04c-26971c5789ea",
                                        "entry_id": "e7c94426-9b19-3d15-8fcb-85e63a859bef",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A parochial individual."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "61be4b2b-70fc-4a6b-8cde-a8f54f8c6df4",
                                                "sense_id": "e43546ce-663e-31ab-b04c-26971c5789ea",
                                                "text": "Australia is divided between cosmopolitans and parochials."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "81c1856c-d04c-49f9-9e38-b8b01824f0d5",
                                                "sense_id": "e43546ce-663e-31ab-b04c-26971c5789ea",
                                                "text": "If the vast majority of the citizens of our Southeast Asian countries are subjects rather than parochials, the question is: are they also participants?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
